ich egg finials atop the minaret spires, symbols of fertility and purity.","qibla pilasters":"Pilaster buttresses stiffening the qibla wall. Exact count is schematic.","qibla toron beams":"Toron palm-stick beams on the qibla wall, scaffolding for the annual replastering. Exact count is schematic.","north wall":"The north outer wall. Exact breaks are schematic.","south wall":"The south outer wall. Exact breaks are schematic.","west wall":"The west outer wall. Exact breaks are schematic.","wall buttresses":"Rectangular buttresses on the outer walls. Exact count and spacing are schematic.","north buttresses":"Rectangular buttresses on the north wall. Exact count is schematic.","south buttresses":"Rectangular buttresses on the south wall. Exact count is schematic.","west buttresses":"Rectangular buttresses on the west wall. Exact count is schematic.","wall toron beams":"Toron beams on the outer walls. Exact count is schematic.","north toron beams":"Toron beams on the north wall. Exact count is schematic.","south toron beams":"Toron beams on the south wall. Exact count is schematic.","west toron beams":"Toron beams on the west wall. Exact count is schematic.","wall merlons":"Cone-capped merlons crowning the walls. Exact count is schematic.","doors":"Doors around the mosque, part of the 36 doors. Exact count and positions are schematic.","prayer hall pillars":"The 90 massive pillars of the prayer hall, formed by nine interior walls with pointed arches.","prayer hall roof":"The mud-covered prayer hall roof on rodier-palm beams. Exact build-up is schematic.","roof vents":"Ventilation caps on the roof that let hot air escape. Exact count is schematic.","west entrance":"The entrance portal in the west wall. Exact form is schematic.","mihrab niches":"Mihrab niches in the qibla wall marking the direction of Mecca. Exact forms are schematic.","courtyard and galleries":"The interior courtyard with galleries on three sides. Exact forms are schematic."},"parts":[{"id":"platform","n